        "_fuente": "https://chicagocitywire.com/patricia-r-ember-trustee-and-patricia-r-ember-trust-acquire-2550-n-lakeview-ave-n9-01-chicago/",
        "_titulo": "Patricia R. Ember (trustee) and Patricia R. Ember (trust) acquire ...",
        "texto_raw": "Patricia R. Ember (trustee) and Patricia R. Ember (trust) acquire 2550 N. Lakeview Ave. N9-01, Chicago - Chicago City Wire\nSkip to content\nPatricia R. Ember (trustee) and Patricia R. Ember (trust) acquire 2550 N. Lakeview Ave. N9-01, Chicago\nReal Estate\nAdobe Stock\nFacebook\nTwitter\nEmail\nSep 30, 2021\nBy\nChicago City Wire\n0\nComments\nOn Sept. 30, Katherine and Timothy G. Clarke sold their home at 2550 N. Lakeview Ave. N9-01, Chicago to Patricia R. Ember (trustee) and Patricia R. Ember (trust) for $900,000.\nIn 2019, the property tax paid for this property was $19,909.83, which is 2.21% of the sale price of the home.\nThis home last sold on Jan. 26, 2015 for $905,500.\nSo far in September 2021, 221 properties sold in Lincoln Park.\nAccording to the Illinois State Board of Elections, there were 313 registered voters residing at 2550 N. Lakeview Ave. N9-01 as of Oct. 10, 2020: Bernard R. Seguy, 80, Timothy E. McChesney, 63, Marianne Berger, 57, Ethan Hall, Susan Mary Coffin, 66, Tracy Ann Clifford, 39, Cynthia R. Brunelli, 67, Mahmoud Hariri, 96, Donald Cameron Findlay, 62, Jann Jacobs Silverton, 69, Matthew Hall, Allison Sontag, 28, William D. Poindexter, 46, Christopher J. Esbrook, 42, Sara Kh Sargent, 75, James Gearen, Lawrence H. Zager, 67, Eva Elizabeth Minisini, 23, Jacquelyn Nordmann, Gustavo A. Dicrosta, 50, James A. Kartheiser, 69, Sean M Oneil, 31, Andrew Zelby, 59, Claudia Delbusto, 55, Theresa M Skwarek, 56, Harchand Sandhu, 82, Craig Douglas Howard, 65, Katherine E Napleton, 35, Darwin Eton, 64, Joe a Meisel, 81, Stephanie Smart, Lorna K. Widdes, 67, Anna Shields Draft, 34, Kanwal D. Ghaey, 68, Sheila R. Amend, 77, James F. Lodas, 79, Galia Newberger, Michael Salehi, Mary Frances Levy, 77, Jose M. Velasco, 74, Jeannine Cleary, Peter Currie Mitchell, 65, Virginia Grimes, Susan A. Stone, 59, Rita Havey, David J. Miniat, 61, Judy Tauber Zager, 68, Katherine A. Kennedy-Kartheiser, 67, Christina a Davenport, 65, James H. Berman, 58, Stephen T. Spates, 51, Sandra Boles, Malcolm C. MacDonald, 68, Marie R. Andrea, 80, Curtis Nelson Smith, 33, Elizabeth Sydney Kaplan, 30, Ssandra Filler Boles, 62, Shail M. Ghaey, 37, Ashok Raojibhai Patel, 81, Ruth M Durchslag, 69, Steven A. Minisini, 61, Ronald S. Jacobs, 72, Dawn Elizabeth Jimenez, 40, Heidi J. Voorhees, 63, Lawrence a Cook, 60, Cecilia Eliza Boles, 24, Theresa Skwarek Rozario, Ragini Shekhawat, 50, Sherwood L. Bollier, 70, Nancy Blair Durden, 65, Joseph C. Andrea, 50, Mehmet Emrah Ayaydin, 47, Linda S. Wolf, 73, Ravinder K. Sandhu, 80, Lisa C. Cox, 57, Edward J Peschel, 103, Susan Marie Oltmanns, 67, Lisa L. Miniat, 60, Romana Younan, 32, Laren A. Ukman, 61, John E. Montague, 67, Christopher B. Newman, 32, Stephen Robert Napleton, 68, Lisa Groos, Ginger Rogers-Synnott, Stanley L. Barrish, 77, Kenneth J. Galvin, 70, Mark B. Tresnowski, 62, Susan Kay Schopfer, 72, Sharyn J. Garritano, 73, Jordan M. Hadelman, 67, Betty Fleurimond, Sandra Filler Boles, 62, Laura E. Poindexter, 45, James Robert Paul, 69"
